msgid "Noopener Filter"
msgstr "Noopener-Filter"

msgid "Provides a filter to add rel=\"noopener\" to external links and links in the ckeditor."
msgstr "Stellt einen Filter zum Hinzufügen von rel=\"noopener\" zu externen Links und Links im ckeditor bereit."

msgid "Noopener filter settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen für Noopener-Filter"

msgid "Change settings for noopener filter"
msgstr "Einstellungen für Noopener-Filter ändern"

msgid "Administer Noopener filter"
msgstr "Noopener-Filter verwalten"

msgid "Enables the ability to change the noopener filter settings."
msgstr "Biete die Möglichkeit, die Einstellungen für den Noopener-Filter zu ändern."

msgid "Settings for Noopener filter"
msgstr "Einstellungen für Noopener-Filter"

msgid "Noopener"
msgstr "Noopener"

msgid "Filter links"
msgstr "Links filtern"

msgid "Filter links through alter link hook."
msgstr "Filtern Sie Links über den Hook zum Ändern von Links."

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Speichern"

msgid "Add noopener to all links"
msgstr "Noopener zu allen Links hinzufügen"

